   126→    }
   127→
   128→    /**
   129→     * Check the claims of the DAT.
   130→     *
   131→     * @param claims JWS claims of DAT Token.
   132→     * @param extraAttributes Extra attributes to be checked.
   133→     * @return True, if claims are valid.
   134→     */
